                                                "sense_id": "4039f10b-e219-3e25-907b-d6121adb8a04",
                                                "text": "Because of a shortage of W.R. pannier tanks, two \"E6\" 0-6-2 tanks, Nos. 32410/5, were engaged as bankers on the Folkestone Harbour branch at the beginning of March; [...]."
